    "detailed_description": "<h1>Mahjong Solitaire Pro</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/17a7cfb498bd24d76e7f0f542f09b3eb.avif?t=1754314182\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mahjong Solitaire Pro offers a relaxing yet engaging experience, where every match brings a sense of satisfaction and focus. With each cleared board, you\u2019ll feel a mix of calm and accomplishment, making it the perfect way to unwind after a hard day at work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/5da16b8915b0101b09489c273685a7ed.poster.avif?t=1754314182\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/5da16b8915b0101b09489c273685a7ed.webm?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/5da16b8915b0101b09489c273685a7ed.mp4?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mahjong Solitaire Pro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Solitaire Pro is a relaxing yet rewarding take on the classic tile-matching game. Every move brings a sense of focus and satisfaction as you clear the board piece by piece. Whether you're unwinding or sharpening your mind, the game provides a soothing yet engaging challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/579aba2239e00a846a9c5cb9bee6e955.poster.avif?t=1754314182\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/579aba2239e00a846a9c5cb9bee6e955.webm?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/579aba2239e00a846a9c5cb9bee6e955.mp4?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With helpful hints and a unique shuffle feature to refresh the board, you\u2019ll always have a way forward. Customize your experience, test your strategy, and enjoy the timeless joy of mahjong solitaire at your own pace.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mahjong Solitaire Pro offers a relaxing yet engaging experience, where every match brings a sense of satisfaction and focus. With each cleared board, you\u2019ll feel a mix of calm and accomplishment, making it the perfect way to unwind after a hard day at work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/5da16b8915b0101b09489c273685a7ed.poster.avif?t=1754314182\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/5da16b8915b0101b09489c273685a7ed.webm?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/5da16b8915b0101b09489c273685a7ed.mp4?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mahjong Solitaire Pro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Solitaire Pro is a relaxing yet rewarding take on the classic tile-matching game. Every move brings a sense of focus and satisfaction as you clear the board piece by piece. Whether you're unwinding or sharpening your mind, the game provides a soothing yet engaging challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/579aba2239e00a846a9c5cb9bee6e955.poster.avif?t=1754314182\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/579aba2239e00a846a9c5cb9bee6e955.webm?t=1754314182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/579aba2239e00a846a9c5cb9bee